        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 95024, 4\" x 4\"  x 1/4 Radius Corner Single Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with a Pair (2) Single Action Spring Door Hinges, Tension Adjusting Tool, Locking Pins and installation screws.  Utilizes ANSI template screw hole pattern for use with wood or metal doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEmtek spring hinges are UL Listed for fire door applications.  Pivot point aligns with residential butt hinges.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe included Tension Tool is use to adjust spring tension.  The Locking Pins hold the Spring in tension after it is set. These adjustable tension spring hinges allow you to determine how much closing force you apply  to the door (how hard/fast the door self closes). \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 95014 Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: 1/4\" Radius Corners</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .110 (standard)</li>\r\n<li>Number of Holes: 8</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Spring Torque</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed for fire door applications.</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 11</li>\r\n<li>Packaged complete with installation screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/specials/pdf/emtek/EMT-95024-specifications.pdf\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 95014 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/specials/pdf/emtek/EMT-95024-installation.pdf\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 95024 Installation Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-11-Finish.jpg?v=1704354624\" width=\"600\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p><p>\r\n<b>Sold as a pair (2 Hinges).</b>\r\n</p>",
